{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297800","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297800","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1029780001:0":{"text":"히히, 이걸 조금 붓고 물을 타면 한 병으로 세 병을 만들 수 있으니까...","source_cn":"嘿嘿，只要倒点这个，再稍微加一点水，这一瓶就能兑出三瓶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x945CF1D740D2C060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029780002:1":{"text":"스모키! 또 뭐 대충 만들고 있는 거죠! 미르키에게 이상한 거 가르치지 말아요!","source_cn":"阿熏！你又在偷工减料！就不怕带坏蒙蒙吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59296DF3AAF4A1C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029780003:1":{"text":"뭐라는 거야. 이건 생존 기술... 아이고, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그리고 두 서머너 아니야?","source_cn":"说什么呢，这是必备的生活技巧——哎呀，是<style=...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF60050A25DF50D5A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뭐라는 거야. 이건 생존 기술... 아이고, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그리고 두 서머너 아니야?","female":"뭐라는 거야. 이건 생존 기술... 아이고, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 그리고 두 서머너 아니야?","variant_male_record_index":"103190","variant_female_record_index":"103191","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029780004:1":{"text":"쇼핑하러 왔어? 향수 필요해? 아니면 포션? 원하는 효과가 뭐든, 다~있어.","source_cn":"是来购物吗？要不要香水？还是药剂？什么药效的都有——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F1AB7D6A1A33B79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029780005:1":{"text":"이렇게 하자. 특별 할인에 증정품까지 얹어줄게. 그러니까 방금 건 못 본 척해주면...","source_cn":"这样吧，给各位多打一折，再送瓶赠品，刚刚的事就当做没看见——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33B6BF4FC5D9E841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1029780005":{"text":"이렇게 하자. 특별 할인에 증정품까지 얹어줄게. 그러니까 방금 건 못 본 척해주면...","source_cn":"这样吧，给各位多打一折，再送瓶赠品，刚刚的事就当做没看见——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33B6BF4FC5D9E841","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029780006:1":{"text":"아이고, 역시 정의로우시다니까. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","source_cn":"哎呀呀，您还是这么大公无私！那、那我这就告辞了——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x98423EF03168A46C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이고, 역시 정의로우시다니까. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","female":"아이고, 역시 정의로우시다니까. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","variant_male_record_index":"103194","variant_female_record_index":"103195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029780008:1":{"text":"거기 서요!\n여기서 장사해도 된다고 허가한 적은 없는 것 같은데요.","source_cn":"不许逃跑！\\n这次的通商，好像还没说让你到这里摆摊吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5560D474DCE9C2BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029780009:1":{"text":"그리고! 애초에 노점도 없잖아요! 그냥 돌아다니면서 몰래 팔고 있었던 거죠?","source_cn":"不止！你根本连个摊位都没有！就是一边走一边偷偷贩卖……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC775E06F3D23AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029780010:1":{"text":"역시 빈틈을 파고 들었군요. 칼라한테 이를 거예요!","source_cn":"你果然又钻空子了，我要告诉曼卡拉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1011F4563D6940C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1029780011:1":{"text":"어어어, 잠깐! 칼라가 알면 앞으로 미르키 데리고 못 나온다고.","source_cn":"哎呀，别别别！要是让她知道了，我就不能带着蒙蒙出来玩了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CF3CEF0BB8A05B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029780012:1":{"text":"겨우 기회가 생겨서 미르키에게 세상 구경이나 좀 시켜주려고 했던 거야. 그러다 보니까 사람도 있고, 돈도 있어서...","source_cn":"这不是好不容易有这个机会，我带蒙蒙来见见世面，路上看到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x740DBF9EAA2E0E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029780013:1":{"text":"자자, 여기서 함부로 장사하면 안 돼요. 사실...","source_cn":"好啦好啦，你也不要在这里做自己的违法小生意啦，其实啊——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EF29D01266171C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1029780013":{"text":"자자, 여기서 함부로 장사하면 안 돼요. 사실...","source_cn":"好啦好啦，你也不要在这里做自己的违法小生意啦，其实啊——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EF29D01266171C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029780014:1":{"text":"뭐?! 이건 하늘이 주신 기회야! 대박이 터질 기회라고!","source_cn":"哦？！这可是天赐良机！发大财的机会来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x615869B117FBFEF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029780015:1":{"text":"하지만 진짜 재료만 써야하는 거 잊지 말아요. 아니면 칼라랑 브루투스 님을 부를 필요도 없이 저희가 혼내줄 거니까요!","source_cn":"但是要真材实料，不许弄虚作假！否则，不用叫曼卡拉和布鲁...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD83A7EB331076678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029780016:1":{"text":"알았어, 알았어. 흐흐흐, 내가 장사는 또 정직하게 하거든. 나만 믿어!","source_cn":"明白明白，嘿嘿嘿，我做生意最老实了，就相信我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64EDEFE150566C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029780017:1":{"text":"미르키, 이번엔 놀지 말고, 같이 돈이나 왕창 벌어보자고!","source_cn":"蒙蒙，这次就别玩了，我们一起多赚点钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1A162FA8E6A3A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","source_cn":"（告知庆典和集市的计划）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4DD6DBF99101680","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","female":"(축제와 시장 계획을 알려준다)","variant_male_record_index":"59884","variant_female_record_index":"59885","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"그럴 순 없지","source_cn":"这可不行","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC04990DDA4A0B0FC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럴 순 없지","female":"그럴 순 없지","variant_male_record_index":"59874","variant_female_record_index":"59875","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029780007:1":{"text":"기사단?! 윽, 진짜 하는 일 많네. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","source_cn":"骑士团？！呃唔，您的兼职还真是多，那、那我就告辞了——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x66C40EC56B94EC50","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"기사단?! 윽, 진짜 하는 일 많네. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","female":"기사단?! 윽, 진짜 하는 일 많네. 그, 그럼 나는 이만...","variant_male_record_index":"103196","variant_female_record_index":"103197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"난 기사단을 대표해서 온 거야","source_cn":"我代表骑士团","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x30D87C492EC3A4A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 기사단을 대표해서 온 거야","female":"난 기사단을 대표해서 온 거야","variant_male_record_index":"59876","variant_female_record_index":"59877","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿熏":{"text":"스모키","source":"阿熏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":3}}